{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《怪宿宿 2 想天開》最新一集玩很大！主持馮皓揚（揚揚）被安排挑戰黃河笨豬跳，豈料上台前還意氣風發的他，一站上跳台竟秒變臉，更在墮下瞬間疑似爆粗兼失控喪叫，事後更爆笑解釋自己是「被推下去」，場面極度惹笑！</p><p>馮皓揚跳前意氣風發 站上跳台秒變哭喪臉</p><p>節目中，主持蔡景行（行仔）和馮皓揚（揚揚）獲安排挑戰黃河笨豬跳。行仔笑言自己一直想試但嫌貴，今次能「公器私用」非常興奮。相反，揚揚雖然在上跳台前仍表現得相當從容，意氣風發，但當他真正站到準備躍下的跳台邊緣時，氣焰瞬間消失，臉色大變，換成一副快要哭出來的哭喪臉，前後反差極大，緊張氣氛籠罩全場。</p><p>墮下瞬間疑似爆粗喪叫 馮皓揚怨氣重：爽條毛</p><p>在全場屏息以待下，馮皓揚終於縱身一躍！就在下墜的一瞬間，他完全失控，不僅發出淒厲的喪叫聲，更疑似嚇到爆粗。在半空中上下回彈的過程中，他的怨氣似乎仍未消散，不斷向着鏡頭投訴大叫：「一啲都唔爽、爽條毛！」從他極度真實的反應可見，這次笨豬跳體驗對他來說絕對不是享受，而是滿滿的驚嚇。</p><p>馮皓揚事後爆笑解畫：我係畀人伸一把踢出去</p><p>經歷完驚心動魄的笨豬跳後，揚揚接受訪問時驚魂未定，更爆笑地為自己失控的表現解畫，他笑言自己根本不是主動跳下去的：「我係畀人背後伸一把、踢一腳出去！」對於自己失控尖叫，他也大方承認：「我知道叫到有啲失控，你哋即管笑我啦。」率真的反應讓工作人員哭笑不得。</p><p>網民洗版爆笑：爽條毛絕對是年度金句</p><p>節目播出後，馮皓揚的驚嚇反應引來網民洗版式討論，紛紛表示笑翻。大量留言湧入：「笑到我肚痛！看他那個哭喪臉就知道他真的怕了！」、「『爽條毛』絕對是年度金句，太真實了！」、「好慘但好好笑，被踢出去那段我重看了十次！」、「這才是真人騷的精髓，揚揚的反應100分！」、「犧牲太大了，不過真的好可愛！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1_454777706a8fc46cd54ff.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2_15549086316a8fc476030b6.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3_5205223196a8fc47e2a20a.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/4_15468387986a8fc486991b0.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5_9580205466a8fc48fbd97d.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/6_548919096a8fc497e447f.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/7_17991695216a8fc49e773d5.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/8_6124857736a8fc4a7e77a6.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9_449671566a8fc4b3c6c74.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_878226926a8fc4bbb99da.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_1193635386a8fc4c50f464.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_2471244706a8fc4d2a642c.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_5819242246a8fc4e14b70e.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_11914981636a8fc4ed346af.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_3152500016a8fc4f81883c.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_13406161686a8fc500a2f06.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_2142198276a8fc5097eb92.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_17248405986a8fc51195e59.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_3293324126a8fc5194c0c3.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_5761579276a8fc51f055d7.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_17529675566a8fc52678887.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_14866765996a8fc52d900f5.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T05:19:02.114410+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1005,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}